{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50469","headline":"八一 · 王梵志","name":"八一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"见病须慈遐，（「须慈遐」，伯三六五六卷作「须慈慜」，伯三五五八、斯二七一○、斯三三九三、伯四○九四卷作「慈须愍」。\n）诸方速疗医。\n（「速疗」，伯三五五八卷作「早爲」，伯三六五六卷作「速爲」。\n）若能行此行，大是不思议。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50469.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50469","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}